Start with real source
This JSON file is intentionally unformatted; the extension has not changed it.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Preview before writing
A native VS Code diff shows every proposed formatting change against the untouched file.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Explain every decision
Inspect the language tier, active configuration and safety checks behind the result.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Interactive Playground
Tune source and options side by side, switch between result, diff and explanation, then copy a minimal config.

6
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:10,000
Presets and configuration
Start from a named style, import Prettier settings or generate a project configuration.

7
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Scan the whole workspace safely
Format every supported file in memory and review the list; the scan writes nothing.

8
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:45,000
CLI and CI parity
The same zero-dependency engine checks repositories from the terminal with conventional exit codes.

9
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Use the full power
Preview, explain, tune, scan and enforce one deterministic formatting policy in VS Code and CI.

